Run Frontend - 

Root Directory - 
Npm install
Npm run dev


Run Backend - 

Cd python (go to python directory)

Pip3 install -r requirements.txt

Terminal 1 -
Python3 chat.py

Terminal 2 -
python3 -m uvicorn app:app --reload --port 8001

Terminal 3 - 
python3 -m uvicorn api:app --reload --port 8000

Terminal 4 - 
python3 -m uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8002
